HF_TOKEN=your_hugging_face_token_here

# INSTRUCTIONS:
#    1. Create an .env file in the root of your project (same level as docker-compose.yml).
#    2. Copy the line above into your .env file.
#    3. Generate a new Hugging Face token and replace the value above. Token Generation Guide: https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/en/security-tokens. Make sure to give the following permissions to the token: - Make calls to inference providers (This is the basic permission needed to ask an AI model a question and get a response) - Make calls to Inference Endpoints (This allows you to use specialized or fine-tuned models you might deploy)


#Note: The token is used by the backend to authenticate requests to the Hugging Face API for AI responses.
